# Agent worktrees. Created by the harness under the repo so that a subagent can work on an
# isolated copy; they are scratch, and one left behind at a stale commit is worse than noise
# because `pytest` in it silently resolves `dodo` from the editable install in the main checkout.
.claude/worktrees/
